OL,3,GNEWSA'I want to inspire others to climb
OL,4,Atheir own mountains'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Gurkha has told the BBC he
OL,7,Fwants to inspire others to "climb their
OL,8,Fown mountains".
OL,10,FHari Budha Magar recently became the
OL,11,Ffirst double above-the-knee amputee to
OL,12,Fclimb the highest peak on each of the
OL,13,Fseven continents.
OL,15,FThe 43-year-old, who lost both his legs
OL,16,Ffighting for the British Army in
OL,17,FAfghanistan, said it had been his
OL,18,F"childhood dream" to reach the top of
OL,19,FMount Everest, which was part of the
OL,20,Fchallenge.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
